@startuml fig01_system_overview
title Figure 1: System overview - subsystems and their interfaces
hide circle
hide empty members
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #222222
  ArrowColor #222222
  FontColor #000000
  StereotypeFontColor #444444
  AttributeFontSize 11
}
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #F2F2F2
  BorderColor #777777
  FontColor #222222
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #777777
  FontColor #222222
}
skinparam title {
  FontSize 15
}

class ArmbandFirmware <<subsystem>> {
  ESP32-S3, C++ (Arduino, NimBLE)
  --
  measures the elbow angle (2 IMUs)
  measures muscle activity (1 EMG channel)
  streams 8-byte packets, receives commands
}

class MobileApp <<subsystem>> {
  Flutter / Dart, Android
  --
  pairing and guided calibration
  live exercise session with feedback
  3D digital twin, progress, offline sync
}

class WebPortal <<subsystem>> {
  React / Vite
  --
  patient approval and monitoring
  exercise library and assignment
  clinic administration
}

class SupabaseBackend <<subsystem>> {
  Postgres with row level security
  --
  authentication
  realtime wearable presence
  RPC functions, Edge Functions
}

class AIPipeline <<subsystem>> {
  Python, PyTorch
  --
  trains the elbow rep autoencoder
  exports weights, thresholds, test vectors
}

ArmbandFirmware -right-> MobileApp : BLE GATT:\nsensor packets, commands
AIPipeline .left.> MobileApp : exports\ntrained model
MobileApp -down-> SupabaseBackend : HTTPS, auth,\nrealtime
WebPortal -left-> SupabaseBackend : HTTPS, auth,\nrealtime

@enduml
